%% title: Audit Entry Retention Lifecycle
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> ACTIVE : INSERT audit_entries\n(DB trigger sets retention_until = occurredAt + 10y\nrecord_hash computed, hash chain linked)

  ACTIVE --> ACTIVE : read queries only\n(UPDATE/DELETE rejected by DB rules:\nno_update_audit / no_delete_audit)

  ACTIVE --> ARCHIVED : retention_until approaching\nor compliance archival job\n(copy to cold storage / S3 Glacier)

  ARCHIVED --> SEALED : retention_until reached\n(regulatory lock — EBA ICT / CNB / AMLD\n10-year mandatory retention elapsed)

  SEALED --> [*] : legal hold released\n(purge authorized by compliance officer)

  note right of ACTIVE
    Hash chain integrity verifiable via
    GET /api/v1/audit/integrity.
    Any tampered row breaks the chain.
  end note

  note right of ARCHIVED
    Rows stay queryable in DB.
    Cold copy held for disaster recovery
    and regulatory inspection.
  end note

  note right of SEALED
    No application-layer path to delete.
    Only explicit DBA + compliance
    dual-authorization can purge.
  end note
